WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.750
Select the phone in the direct chat.

00:01.750 --> 00:03.250
Anna is calling Boris. She can cancel while waiting.

00:03.250 --> 00:07.000
Boris sees who is calling and chooses Accept.

00:07.000 --> 00:11.750
Both friends are in the room. Each controls their own microphone.

00:11.750 --> 00:15.500
Anna opens the direct chat. The call continues.

00:15.500 --> 00:17.250
Choose Room to return to the call.
